OL,3,AFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,4,ADott jailed for child sexual abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world snooker champion Graeme
OL,7,FDott is jailed for seven years for
OL,8,Fchild sexual abuse offences
OL,10,FThe 49-year-old was convicted in August
OL,11,Fof two charges of lewd and libidinous
OL,12,Fbehaviour towards a girl and a boy
OL,14,FThe offences took place between 1993
OL,15,Fand 2010
OL,17,FDott, who won the world snooker title
OL,18,Fin 2006, showed no emotion as he was
OL,19,Fsentenced at the High Court in
OL,20,FEdinburgh
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
